# Program Capacity & Invoice Reservation - example requests
#
# Works with the VS Code REST Client and the JetBrains HTTP client.
# Run `docker compose up -d`, `npm run migration:run`, `npm run seed` first.

@host = http://localhost:3000
@program = PRG-USD-001

### Get a token (admin can also create programs and change limits)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@demo.local", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Store the token
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Current capacity
GET {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/capacity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reserve for an invoice in the program's own currency
POST {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-2026-000123",
  "amount": { "amount": "250000.00", "currency": "USD" },
  "externalReference": "ERP-98765"
}

### Reserve for an invoice in another currency (converted at the stored rate)
POST {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-002

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-2026-000124",
  "amount": { "amount": "1000000.00", "currency": "EUR" }
}

### Retry the same request: returns the original reservation, 200 not 201
POST {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-002

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-2026-000124",
  "amount": { "amount": "1000000.00", "currency": "EUR" }
}

### Ask for more than is available: 409 with the numbers in the body
POST {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-TOO-BIG",
  "amount": { "amount": "50000000.00", "currency": "USD" }
}

### List reservations (cursor-paged, newest first)
GET {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/reservations?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Release after repayment
POST {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/reservations/INV-2026-000124/release
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Invoice repaid in full" }

### Cancel a reservation that will not be paid out
POST {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/reservations/INV-2026-000123/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Approval withdrawn" }

### Audit trail (cursor-paged, newest first)
# @name ledger
GET {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/ledger?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Next page, using the cursor from the previous response
GET {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/ledger?limit=5&cursor={{ledger.response.body.nextCursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Raise the credit limit (admin only)
PATCH {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/limit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "totalLimit": { "amount": "15000000.00", "currency": "USD" } }

### Create a program (admin only)
POST {{host}}/v1/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PRG-GBP-001",
  "name": "UK Receivables GBP",
  "totalLimit": { "amount": "2000000.00", "currency": "GBP" }
}

### Stream capacity changes (server-sent events)
GET {{host}}/v1/programs/{{program}}/capacity/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/readyz

### Metrics
GET {{host}}/metrics
